            "detailed_description": "<strong>The Next BIG Thing</strong> is the new, hilarious adventure gem from the creators of Runaway. A great adventure game in high definition, loaded with laughs, tributes, mysteries and wacky puzzles!<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tThanks to a production worthy of a great animated movie, an awesome soundtrack, delightful dialogue and a great art style, The Next BIG Thing will make you live an unforgettable adventure which brilliantly takes players across the fantastic movie genres of a totally crazy Hollywood.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Hollywood</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t\tWhat if horror movies' monsters were actually played by real monsters? And what if they were now forced to play in movies for kids, romantic comedies or even musicals? And what would happen if, eventually, they were to rebel?<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tIn that context, Liz Allaire, talented journalist who can't count up to 4, and Dan Murray, a tough macho who can't stand beetles, attend the horror movies award ceremony… there is the starting point of an incredible story, full of twists and turns! Help Liz and Dan solve the numerous mysteries of an amazing adventure that you won't forget any time soon!<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The new adventure game from the creators of the million-copy seller, the &quot;Runaway&quot; saga.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Production, graphics, and sound worth a great animation movie.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>A cast of colorful characters, including some of the most legendary monsters and creatures from fantastic movies that our heroes will encounter during their adventure.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Many crazy mysteries, puzzles and situations to solve.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>The Next BIG Thing</strong> is the new, hilarious adventure gem from the creators of Runaway. A great adventure game in high definition, loaded with laughs, tributes, mysteries and wacky puzzles!<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tThanks to a production worthy of a great animated movie, an awesome soundtrack, delightful dialogue and a great art style, The Next BIG Thing will make you live an unforgettable adventure which brilliantly takes players across the fantastic movie genres of a totally crazy Hollywood.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong>Hollywood</strong><br>\t\t\t\t\t\tWhat if horror movies' monsters were actually played by real monsters? And what if they were now forced to play in movies for kids, romantic comedies or even musicals? And what would happen if, eventually, they were to rebel?<br>\t\t\t\t\t\tIn that context, Liz Allaire, talented journalist who can't count up to 4, and Dan Murray, a tough macho who can't stand beetles, attend the horror movies award ceremony… there is the starting point of an incredible story, full of twists and turns! Help Liz and Dan solve the numerous mysteries of an amazing adventure that you won't forget any time soon!<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The new adventure game from the creators of the million-copy seller, the &quot;Runaway&quot; saga.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Production, graphics, and sound worth a great animation movie.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>A cast of colorful characters, including some of the most legendary monsters and creatures from fantastic movies that our heroes will encounter during their adventure.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li>Many crazy mysteries, puzzles and situations to solve.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "The Next Big Thing is a great adventure game in high definition, loaded with laughs, tributes, mysteries and wacky puzzles!",
